sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant HTTP as HTTP Server (FastAPI)<br/>8080/TCP TLS
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>8085/TCP TLS/mTLS
    participant Wrapper as CaikitRuntimeServerWrapper<br/>Interceptor + Metrics
    participant Predict as GlobalPredictServicer
    participant Train as GlobalTrainServicer
    participant MM as ModelManager<br/>Thread-safe registry
    participant Module as Module.run()<br/>AI Model
    participant MMesh as ModelMesh Controller<br/>Unix socket
    participant MRS as ModelRuntimeServicer
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    Note over Client, Module: Flow 1: HTTP Inference (JSON or SSE streaming)
    Client->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/task/{task_name}<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>TLS (configurable)
    HTTP->>Predict: Route dispatch (FastAPI)
    Predict->>MM: retrieve_model(model_id)
    MM->>Module: module.run(input)
    Module-->>MM: DataBase result
    MM-->>Predict: Inference result
    Predict-->>HTTP: JSON or SSE stream
    HTTP-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>application/json or text/event-stream

    Note over Client, Module: Flow 2: gRPC Inference (unary or streaming)
    Client->>GRPC: Predict RPC<br/>gRPC TLS/mTLS
    GRPC->>Wrapper: Intercept (metrics, context)
    Wrapper->>Predict: Forward to servicer
    Predict->>MM: retrieve_model(model_id)
    MM->>Module: module.run(input)
    Module-->>MM: Protobuf response
    MM-->>Predict: Inference result
    Predict-->>Wrapper: Response
    Wrapper-->>GRPC: Add metrics
    GRPC-->>Client: Predict Response<br/>gRPC TLS/mTLS

    Note over MMesh, FS: Flow 3: ModelMesh Integration (model lifecycle)
    MMesh->>MRS: loadModel(model_id, path)<br/>Unix socket gRPC (plaintext)
    MRS->>MM: load_model(model_id)
    MM->>FS: Read model artifacts
    FS-->>MM: Model files
    MM-->>MRS: Model loaded (size info)
    MRS-->>MMesh: LoadModelResponse<br/>(model size, max concurrency)

    Note over Client, FS: Flow 4: Training Job
    Client->>GRPC: Train RPC<br/>gRPC TLS
    GRPC->>Train: Forward to servicer
    Train->>MM: submit_training(module, params)
    MM->>Module: Module.train() [async]
    Module->>FS: Write trained model artifacts
    Train-->>GRPC: TrainingJob ID + status
    GRPC-->>Client: Training submitted
    Note right of Module: Training runs async<br/>Client polls for status<br/>via TrainingManagement
